{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47253","headline":"谒尧帝庙 · 轩辕弥明","name":"谒尧帝庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"祖龙开国尽遐荒，庙建唐尧镇此邦。\n山卷白云朝帝座，林疎红日列仙幢。\n巍巍圣蹟陵松峤，荡荡恩波洽桂江。\n瞻仰威灵共回首，紫霞深处锁轩窗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"轩辕弥明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47253.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47253","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}